<section id="resources">
  <div class="">
    <h1>Preserving Natural Resources</h1>
    <p>
      Natural resources like water, forests, and minerals are vital for human
      survival. Protecting these resources ensures their availability for future
      generations and supports sustainable development.
    </p>

    <h2>Types of Renewable Energy</h2>

    <div class="card-container">
      <div class="card">
        <img src="/img/solar.jpg" alt="Solar Energy" />
        <h3>Solar Energy ☀️</h3>
        <p>
          Solar energy is derived from sunlight and converted into electricity
          using solar panels. It is a clean and sustainable source of power with
          no harmful emissions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <img src="/img/images (5).jpeg" alt="Wind Energy" />
        <h3>Wind Energy 🌬️</h3>
        <p>
          Wind turbines convert wind’s kinetic energy into electricity, making
          it a clean and widely available source in coastal and high-wind areas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <img src="/img/images (4).jpeg" alt="Hydropower" />
        <h3>Hydropower 💧</h3>
        <p>
          Hydropower generates electricity by using the movement of water
          through dams or rivers. It is an efficient and renewable energy
          source.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <img src="/img/images (3).jpeg" alt="Geothermal Energy" />
        <h3>Geothermal Energy 🌍</h3>
        <p>
          Geothermal energy utilizes heat from beneath the Earth's surface for
          electricity production and heating purposes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <img src="/img/energy-crops.jpg" alt="Biomass Energy" />
        <h3>Biomass Energy 🌿</h3>
        <p>
          Biomass energy is generated from organic materials like plants and
          animal waste, which can be burned or converted into biofuels.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Benefits of Renewable Energy ✅</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reduces carbon emissions and fights climate change.</li>
      <li>Relies on replenishable natural sources, ensuring sustainability.</li>
      <li>Enhances energy security by reducing dependence on fossil fuels.</li>
      <li>
        Creates job opportunities in engineering, maintenance, and production.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Challenges of Renewable Energy ⚠️</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>High initial investment in infrastructure and technology.</li>
      <li>Requires efficient energy storage and distribution solutions.</li>
      <li>Some large-scale projects may impact local ecosystems.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Investing in clean energy solutions ensures a sustainable future and a
      healthier environment for generations to come.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
